WEBVTT

00:01:05.816 --> 00:01:06.901
Peek-a-boo!

00:01:08.402 --> 00:01:09.653
No, no, no, no, no.

00:01:09.737 --> 00:01:12.907
I didn't mean to startle you, my little baby.

00:01:15.117 --> 00:01:18.996
Hush, little vampire, don't say a word

00:01:19.079 --> 00:01:22.249
Papa's gonna bite the head off a bird

00:01:27.171 --> 00:01:29.507
I vant to kiss your tush.

00:01:30.007 --> 00:01:31.592
I vant to kiss your tush!

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:46.774
Nice, but maybe a little more square footage.

00:01:46.857 --> 00:01:49.944
I want a lot of monsters here.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:58.202
I'm gonna get you, little Mavis.

00:01:58.285 --> 00:02:00.496
I'm gonna get you!

00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:04.375
What out there?

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.836
We never go out there.

00:02:06.961 --> 00:02:08.295
Ever.

00:02:09.839 --> 00:02:13.759
"And then the monsters ran away
and were forced into hiding.

00:02:14.009 --> 00:02:17.847
"But Harry the Human found them
and jumped out from under their bed."

00:02:17.972 --> 00:02:20.307
-I'm scared!
-"And burned their clothes

00:02:20.349 --> 00:02:22.309
"and bit their toes!

00:02:22.393 --> 00:02:24.478
"And took their candy!"

00:02:26.897 --> 00:02:28.399
Don't take my candy.

00:02:28.482 --> 00:02:31.485
Babyclaws, you don't need to be frightened.

00:02:31.527 --> 00:02:36.240
I promised your mommy
I would protect you forever.

00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:42.580
My beautiful May-vay

00:02:42.663 --> 00:02:47.167
Let me wipe all your poop away

00:02:47.251 --> 00:02:51.046
Those humans are nas-tay

00:02:51.171 --> 00:02:55.259
So with Daddy you will stay

00:02:55.342 --> 00:02:59.680
And if a human tries to harm you

00:02:59.722 --> 00:03:01.348
I'll simply say...

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:07.688
Because you're Daddy's girl

00:03:07.730 --> 00:03:09.857
Daddy's girl

00:03:09.899 --> 00:03:11.108
I'm your Vlad-y daddy...

00:03:11.191 --> 00:03:13.694
Just bend the legs and push off.

00:03:13.736 --> 00:03:15.863
Trust me, mouse.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:20.075
I can fly! I can fly!

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:21.201
Look at you!

00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:22.870
Faster, baby! Faster!

00:03:23.287 --> 00:03:25.372
You got it, my little voodoo doll!

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:33.213
Excuse me, sir.

00:03:33.297 --> 00:03:34.882
What? What?

00:03:35.466 --> 00:03:36.884
I'm okay.

00:03:36.926 --> 00:03:38.719
It's ready.

00:03:40.763 --> 00:03:42.097
Looks good.

00:03:42.222 --> 00:03:44.058
Only monsters can get in?

00:03:44.141 --> 00:03:45.559
Absolutely.

00:03:45.643 --> 00:03:47.436
It's hidden real nicely.

00:03:47.561 --> 00:03:50.439
You got 400 acres
of haunted forest in front of you.

00:03:50.564 --> 00:03:53.400
You got the Land of the Undead
on the perimeters.

00:03:53.484 --> 00:03:58.072
Any humans daring to even look over there
will run away real quick.

00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:14.088
But, of course, be smart.

00:04:14.171 --> 00:04:16.590
No bonfires, no firework shows.

00:04:16.674 --> 00:04:19.593
Yeah, yeah, no, no. No fire, I get it, I get it.

00:04:23.263 --> 00:04:25.182
It's time, my darling Martha.

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:28.686
The place we always talked about for Mavis.

00:04:28.769 --> 00:04:31.772
No one will ever harm her here.

00:05:24.241 --> 00:05:26.994
Yeah, it's a mess back there.

00:05:41.341 --> 00:05:44.762
Welcome to Hotel Transylvania!

00:05:46.847 --> 00:05:49.308
Human-free since 1898.

00:05:49.391 --> 00:05:50.934
Your safest destination.

00:05:51.018 --> 00:05:52.227
Take an itinerary.

00:05:52.311 --> 00:05:55.230
I have personally designed
a spectacular schedule of events,

00:05:55.314 --> 00:05:59.151
all leading to my daughter's
birthday extravaganza tomorrow.

00:05:59.234 --> 00:06:01.528
We always look forward
to coming every year, Count.

00:06:01.612 --> 00:06:03.447
We enjoy the safety so much.

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.783
Of course. That's why we built it.

00:06:05.866 --> 00:06:07.493
Yes, good evening.

00:06:07.576 --> 00:06:08.619
Thank you, Marty.

00:06:08.702 --> 00:06:10.996
You look pale, as well.

00:06:11.121 --> 00:06:12.664
Sir, sir, sir!

00:06:12.706 --> 00:06:14.208
We have an urgent plumbing issue.

00:06:14.291 --> 00:06:15.542
Plumbing? On it.

00:06:15.667 --> 00:06:17.669
Mr. Ghouligan!

00:06:17.711 --> 00:06:20.881
There is a clogged toilet in room 348.

00:06:22.341 --> 00:06:24.635
It's okay.
We all get stomach aches, Mr. Bigfoot.

00:06:32.392 --> 00:06:33.894
Hey, kids, reel it in.

00:06:33.977 --> 00:06:36.355
You're only supposed to make
Mom and Dad miserable.

00:06:37.606 --> 00:06:39.483
Now, now, is that any way to behave?

00:06:39.566 --> 00:06:41.902
This is a hotel, not a cemetery.

00:06:41.985 --> 00:06:43.987
Sorry, Uncle Drac.

00:06:44.905 --> 00:06:46.156
Drac! How are ya?

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:47.574
Wayne, my old friend!

00:06:47.658 --> 00:06:48.992
Couldn't wait for this weekend.

00:06:49.076 --> 00:06:50.994
Always great to be out of
the shadows for a couple days.

00:06:51.078 --> 00:06:52.538
The family looks beautiful.

00:06:52.621 --> 00:06:54.414
Let me just clean up their filth.

00:06:54.498 --> 00:06:55.666
Housekeeping!

